$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4

::Q001::[markdown]The **5th Principal Part** is the::{
	~%-100%Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%100%Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Correct: the 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**.
	~%-100%Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 5th Principal Part is **Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
}


::Q002::[markdown]Pick the 3rd Principal Part of ἐθέλω.:{
	~%100%ἠθέλησα#Correct: **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔθαψα#Incorrect. **ἔθαψα** is Principal Part 3 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐθελήσω#Incorrect. **ἐθελήσω** is Principal Part 2 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐπαίδευσα#Incorrect. **ἐπαίδευσα** is Principal Part 3 of **παιδεύω** “educate” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%ἐκέλευσα#Incorrect. **ἐκέλευσα** is Principal Part 3 of **κελεύω** “command” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%ἐφύλαξα#Incorrect. **ἐφύλαξα** is Principal Part 3 of **φυλάττω** “guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἐθέλω#Incorrect. **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἠθέληκα#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q003::[markdown]πολίτης, πολίτου, ὁ:{
	~%100%citizen#Correct: **πολίτης, πολίτου, ὁ** → “citizen” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%rhetoric#Incorrect. **ῤητορική, ῤητορικῆς, ἠ** means “rhetoric” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%line of battle#Incorrect. **φάλαγξ, φάλαγγος, ἡ** means “line of battle” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%justice#Incorrect. **δίκη, δίκης, ἡ** means “justice” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%gratitude#Incorrect. **χάρις, χάριτος, ἡ** means “gratitude” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%priest#Incorrect. **ἱερεύς, ἱερέως, ὁ** means “priest” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%father#Incorrect. **πατήρ, πατρός, ὁ** means “father” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%mind#Incorrect. **γνώμη, γνώμης, ἡ** means “mind” (Chapter 6).
}


::Q004::[markdown]κακός, κακή, κακόν:{
	~%-100%well-born#Incorrect. **εὐγενής, εὑγενές** means “well-born” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%dear#Incorrect. **φίλος, φίλη, φίλοv** means “dear” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%-self#Incorrect. **αὐτός, αὐτή, αὐτό** means “-self” (Chapter 11).
	~%100%bad#Correct: **κακός, κακή, κακόν** → “bad” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%this (here)#Incorrect. **ὅδε, ἥδε, τόδε** means “this (here)” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%uncertain#Incorrect. **ἄδηλος, ἄδηλον** means “uncertain” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%all, every#Incorrect. **πας, πασα, παν** means “all, every” (Chapter 8).
}


::Q005::[markdown]ἀρχή, ἀρχῆς, ἡ:{
	~%-100%excellence#Incorrect. **ἀρετή, ἀρετῆς, ἡ** means “excellence” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%(pl.) documents#Incorrect. **γράμμα, γράμματος, τό** means “(pl.) documents” (Chapter 7).
	~%100%rule#Correct: **ἀρχή, ἀρχῆς, ἡ** → “rule” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%nature#Incorrect. **φύσις, φύσεως, ἡ** means “nature” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%sea#Incorrect. **θάλαττα, θαλάττης, ἡ** means “sea” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%rogue#Incorrect. **κλέπτης, κλέπτου, ὁ** means “rogue” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%character#Incorrect. **τρόπος, τρόπου, ὁ** means “character” (Chapter 9).
}


