::Q010::[markdown]Which Principal Part of τάττω is ‘τάξω’?:{
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 6th.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 1st.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 4th.
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 3rd.
	~%100%2nd#Correct: **τάξω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
}


