	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is the 4th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 6th.
	~%100%4th#Correct: **τέταχα** is the 4th Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is the 4th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is the 4th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is the 4th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 1st.
}


::Q013::[markdown]The **2nd Principal Part** is the::{
	~%-100%Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%100%Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Correct: the 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**.
	~%-100%Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 2nd Principal Part is **Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
}


