::Q018::[markdown]The **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on which Principal Part?:{
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 3rd.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 4th.
	~%100%6th#Correct: **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 1st.
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 5th.
}


