::Q022::[markdown]τάττω:{
	~%-100%unbind#Incorrect. **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “unbind” (Chapter 2).
	~%100%arrange, order#Correct: **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “arrange, order” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%save#Incorrect. **σῴζω** is Principal Part 1 of **σῴζω** “save” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%to honor#Incorrect. **τιμάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τιμάω** “to honor” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%hear (+ gen. of person)#Incorrect. **ἀκούω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀκούω** “hear (+ gen. of person)” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%finish#Incorrect. **τελευτάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τελευτάω** “finish” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%(middle) obey#Incorrect. **πείθω** is Principal Part 1 of **πείθω** “(middle) obey” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%remain#Incorrect. **μένω** is Principal Part 1 of **μένω** “remain” (Chapter 10).
}


::Q023::[markdown]Which of these forms is based on the **1st Principal Part**?:{
	~%-100%Future (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Future (active, middle)** forms are based on the 2nd Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Perfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Perfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%100%Present (active, middle, passive)#Correct: **Present (active, middle, passive)** forms are based on the 1st Principal Part.
	~%-100%Aorist (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Aorist (active, middle)** forms are based on the 3rd Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Future (passive)#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Pluperfect (active)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Pluperfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Aorist (passive)#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 1st.
}


