	~%-100%real#Incorrect. **ἀλεθής, ἀληθές** means “real” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%visible#Incorrect. **δῆλος, δήλη, δῆλον** means “visible” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%worthy of ( + gen.)#Incorrect. **ἄξιος, ἀξίᾱ, ἄξιον** means “worthy of ( + gen.)” (Chapter 4).
}


